      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_04",
      "hash64": "20DD972EF5E4E69A",
      "text": "Non, qu’est-ce qui se passe ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_07",
      "hash64": "3628B3A5496FDD00",
      "text": "Ah, désolée... Tu m’as fait tellement peur,\\nmon cerveau essaie encore de s’en remettre.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_08",
      "hash64": "3628C2A5496FF67D",
      "text": "Comme tu le sais, les membres de la Team Star\\nsont revenus à l’école...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_09",
      "hash64": "3628C1A5496FF4CA",
      "text": "Et comme je m’inquiète pour eux, je les suis\\npour voir s’ils arrivent à bien s’intégrer...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_01",
      "hash64": "65304FA143DF53AA",
      "text": "Hmmm... J’ai l’impression qu’on est un peu\\ncomme des extraterrestres, ici...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
