    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_01",
      "hash64": "1D3B2C79154455C0",
      "text": "Tu m’étonnes...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_02",
      "hash64": "1D3B2F7915445AD9",
      "text": "On a rétabli la vérité auprès des profs,\\nc’est un fait.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_03",
      "hash64": "1D3B2E7915445926",
      "text": "Mais faire comprendre la situation aux autres\\nélèves, c’est une autre paire de manches...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_02",
      "hash64": "65304EA143DF51F7",
      "text": "Ouais... J’crois qu’on va pas avoir le choix...\\nVa falloir faire un changement radical.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_10",
      "hash64": "3625B4A5496DA8DC",
      "text": "Un changement... radical... ?\\c\\nC’est-à-dire ? Ils vont jeter leurs costumes de\\npop-star et remettre des uniformes normaux ?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_11",
      "hash64": "3625B5A5496DAA8F",
      "text": "Brom’s... Orty... Mes amis... vous êtes vraiment\\nprêts à tout pour vous intégrer...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_04",
      "hash64": "1D3B317915445E3F",
      "text": "Un changement radical ?\\nJe veux bien, mais tu suggères quoi ?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_03",
      "hash64": "65304DA143DF5044",
      "text": "Hein ? Euh, ben...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_04",
      "hash64": "65304CA143DF4E91",
      "text": "Je sais pas, moi... On peut p’têt’ crier « bonjour »\\nà tout le monde de manière super friendly ?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_05",
      "hash64": "1D3B307915445C8C",
      "text": "Quoi ?! T’es fou ou quoi ? Ça serait trop\\nla honte ! J’ai pas envie de me ridiculiser ![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_12",
      "hash64": "3625B6A5496DAC42",
      "text": "Ouais... Ce n’est pas l’idée du siècle...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_05",
      "hash64": "65304BA143DF4CDE",
      "text": "Non mais attends, Ortiga.\\nJ’t’explique.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_06",
      "hash64": "65304AA143DF4B2B",
      "text": "T’as jamais vu un concert de Laïm ?\\nC’est comme ça qu’elle s’y prend.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_07",
      "hash64": "653049A143DF4978",
      "text": "Quand l’ambiance commence à retomber,\\nelle salue son public en criant !\\r\\nEt là, tout le monde lui répond ![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_06",
      "hash64": "1D3B3379154461A5",
      "text": "Ça marche peut-être dans un concert, mais ici,\\non est à l’école, je te rappelle...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_08",
      "hash64": "653048A143DF47C5",
      "text": "T’as une meilleure idée ? Ou peut-être que\\ntu préfères rester isolé pour le reste de ta life...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_07",
      "hash64": "1D3B327915445FF2",
      "text": "N-non... Ce serait le pire...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_09",
      "hash64": "653047A143DF4612",
      "text": "Alors tu vois, on a pas le choix.\\nFaut qu’on s’fasse entendre, toi et moi !\\r\\nAllez, j’y vais. Trois... deux... un...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_10",
      "hash64": "652CCAA143DC3BD4",
      "text": "SALUT TOUT LE MOOOOOONDE !!!\\nQUELLE BELLE MATINÉE !!![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_08",
      "hash64": "1D3B35791544650B",
      "text": "Brome, t’es cinglé ?!\\nTu nous mets carrément la honte !!![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_11",
      "hash64": "652CCBA143DC3D87",
      "text": "COMMENT ALLEZ-VOUS, CET APRÈS-MIDI ?!\\nOrtiga, à toi ![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_09",
      "hash64": "1D3B347915446358",
      "text": "En quoi ça va nous aider à nous intégrer, ça ?!\\nT’as juste envie de hurler, en fait ![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_12",
      "hash64": "652CCCA143DC3F3A",
      "text": "BONSOIR LES AMIS !!!\\nAllez, te fais pas prier ![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
